    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im in the middle of a heavy training block for a triathlon and my hip and quads are killing me. i feel like i need to really push through the inflammation so i dont miss my long ride tomorrow. i have some extra strength tylenol (500mg pills) and i was wondering what the absolute max i can take in a 24 hour period is? i really need to knock this pain out so i can actually sleep and recover.",
